"moon-para": {"kind":"sample","name":"moon-para","file":"moon-para-16k.wav","licence":"own","credit":"macOS say, voice Samantha","source":"","tags":["voice","narration","moon"],"desc":"The moon does not make its own light. It shines because the sun lights it up. As the moon travels around the earth, we see more or less of its bright side. When we see all of it, we call it a full moon. When we see none of it, we call it a new moon. In between, it grows and shrinks a little every night.","sec":18.352,"sha":"54afa39315dcfe04b012d33c5b288bb7b452b41f","ext":"wav","align":{"text":"The moon does not make its own light. It shines because the sun lights it up. As the moon travels around the earth, we see more or less of its bright side. When we see all of it, we call it a full moon. When we see none of it, we call it a new moon. In between, it grows and shrinks a little every night.","by":"whisper","words":[["The",0,0.08],["moon",0.08,0.2],["does",0.2,0.48],["not",0.48,0.72],["make",0.72,1.02],["its",1.02,1.28],["own",1.28,1.48],["light.",1.48,1.8],["It",2.26,2.34],["shines",2.34,2.52],["because",2.52,3.08],["the",3.08,3.34],["sun",3.34,3.56],["lights",3.56,3.9],["it",3.9,4.12],["up.",4.12,4.3],["As",4.68,4.76],["the",4.76,4.92],["moon",4.92,5.08],["travels",5.08,5.4],["around",5.4,6],["the",6,6.22],["earth,",6.22,6.5],["we",6.82,6.96],["see",6.96,7.16],["more",7.16,7.4],["or",7.4,7.46],["less",7.46,7.76],["of",7.76,7.94],["its",7.94,8.1],["bright",8.1,8.34],["side.",8.34,8.8],["When",9.24,9.4],["we",9.4,9.6],["see",9.6,9.82],["all",9.82,10.06],["of",10.06,10.2],["it,",10.2,10.34],["we",10.6,10.8],["call",10.8,11.02],["it",11.02,11.28],["a",11.28,11.34],["full",11.34,11.54],["moon.",11.54,11.78],["When",12.26,12.4],["we",12.4,12.62],["see",12.62,12.84],["none",12.84,13.04],["of",13.04,13.24],["it,",13.24,13.38],["we",13.66,13.82],["call",13.82,14.06],["it",14.06,14.3],["a",14.3,14.4],["new",14.4,14.52],["moon.",14.52,14.8],["In",15.22,15.34],["between,",15.34,15.66],["it",16